{"total": 40.4, "frases": [{"k": "hook", "t0": 0.05, "t1": 2.855, "txt": "To your dog, your Christmas tree looks like a giant toy."}, {"k": "shiny", "t0": 2.955, "t1": 6.289, "txt": "Shiny strings. Hanging balls. And a water bowl at the bottom."}, {"k": "vets", "t0": 6.409, "t1": 8.51, "txt": "Here's what vets warn about every December."}, {"k": "tinsel", "t0": 8.63, "t1": 12.255, "txt": "Tinsel. If he swallows it, it can bunch up and block his intestines."}, {"k": "water", "t0": 12.375, "t1": 16.835, "txt": "The tree water. It can grow bacteria, and hold fertilizer that makes him sick."}, {"k": "choc", "t0": 16.955, "t1": 21.829, "txt": "The chocolate under the tree. Dogs can't process it like we do. The darker, the worse."}, {"k": "orn", "t0": 21.949, "t1": 25.105, "txt": "And glass ornaments. They break, and small ones get swallowed."}, {"k": "fix", "t0": 25.225, "t1": 27.449, "txt": "The good news? The fix takes five minutes."}, {"k": "skip", "t0": 27.549, "t1": 29.35, "txt": "Skip the tinsel. Cover the water."}, {"k": "high", "t0": 29.41, "t1": 32.218, "txt": "Hang the breakables up high. Lock the chocolate away."}, {"k": "tie", "t0": 32.278, "t1": 34.277, "txt": "And tie the tree, so it can't tip over."}, {"k": "safe", "t0": 34.397, "t1": 37.068, "txt": "Now the only thing he'll unwrap is his own present."}, {"k": "cta", "t0": 37.188, "t1": 39.804, "txt": "Send this to someone putting up their tree this weekend."}], "palavras": [{"w": "To", "t0": 0.08, "t1": 0.243, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "your", "t0": 0.243, "t1": 0.487, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "dog,", "t0": 0.487, "t1": 0.69, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "your", "t0": 0.69, "t1": 0.934, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "Christmas", "t0": 0.934, "t1": 1.382, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "tree", "t0": 1.382, "t1": 1.626, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "looks", "t0": 1.626, "t1": 1.911, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "like", "t0": 1.911, "t1": 2.155, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "a", "t0": 2.155, "t1": 2.277, "k": "hook"}, {"w": "giant", "t0": 2.277, "t1": 2.562, "k": "hook"}, {"